DOMAIN-SUFFIX,flytogarden.com,MEXC_JP
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,hotbookzone.com,MEXC_JP
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,greentreeone.com,MEXC_JP
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,coldbookfly.ru,MEXC_JP
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,dgshen.com,MEXC_JP
# 自有监控与埋点：sentry 错误上报、watchman SDK、trochilus
